gn="center">34</td><td align="center">42</td><td align="center">27.05 &#x000b1; 6.02</td><td align="center">1.81 &#x000b1; 0.98</td><td align="center">0.79 &#x000b1; 0.04</td><td align="center">1.79 &#x000b1; 0.28</td><td align="center">57.10 &#x000b1; 9.29</td><td align="center">5.10 &#x000b1; 1.18</td></tr><tr><td align="center">35</td><td align="center">49</td><td align="center">29.21 &#x000b1; 4.65</td><td align="center">2.26 &#x000b1; 1.36</td><td align="center">0.80 &#x000b1; 0.05</td><td align="center">1.75 &#x000b1; 0.33</td><td align="center">52.06 &#x000b1; 9.61</td><td align="center">5.33 &#x000b1; 1.84</td></tr><tr><td align="center">36</td><td align="center">48</td><td align="center">27.92 &#x000b1; 5.62</td><td align="center">2.33 &#x000b1; 1.09</td><td align="center">0.75 &#x000b1; 0.05</td><td align="center">1.54 &#x000b1; 0.26</td><td align="center">56.65 &#x000b1; 12.2</td><td align="center">4.31 &#x000b1; 1.15</td></tr><tr><td align="center">37</td><td align="center">43</td><td align="center">27.94 &#x000b1; 5.05</td><td align="center">1.63 &#x000b1; 0.88</td><td align="center">0.73 &#x000b1; 0.07</td><td align="center">1.43 &#x000b1; 0.31</td><td align="center">53.93 &#x000b1; 16.34</td><td align="center">4.12 &#x000b1; 1.31</td></tr><tr><td align="center">38</td><td align="center">51</td><td align="center">25.29 &#x000b1; 5.65</td><td align="center">1.53 &#x000b1; 0.80</td><td align="center">0.68 &#x000b1; 0.06</td><td align="center">1.25 &#x000b1; 0.21</td><td align="center">56.97 &#x000b1; 15.91</td><td align="center">3.22 &#x000b1; 0.67</td></tr><tr><td align="center">39</td><td align="center">45</td><td align="center">28.33 &#x000b1; 5.66</td><td align="center">2.27 &#x000b1; 1.43</td><td align="center">0.68 &#x000b1; 0.05</td><td align="center">1.23 &#x000b1; 0.15</td><td align="center">60.85 &#x000b1; 18.96</td><td align="center">3.22 &#x000b1; 0.46</td></tr><tr><td align="center">40</td><td align="center">46</td><td align="center">26.50 &#x000b1; 2.33</td><td align="center">1.63 &#x000b1; 0.51</td><td align="center">0.67 &#x000b1; 0.04</td><td align="center">1.23 &#x000b1; 0.16</td><td align="center">54.42 &#x000b1; 23.48</td><td align="center">3.16 &#x000b1; 0.44</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T2"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>5, 50 and 95 percentiles values for Doppler waveforms indices according to gestational age</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><tbody><tr><td></td><td></td><td align="center" colspan="3"><bold>RI</bold></td><td align="center" colspan="3"><bold>PI</bold></td><td align="center" colspan="3"><bold>S/D ratio</bold></td><td align="center" colspan="3"><bold>PSV</bold></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td colspan="3"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="3"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="3"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="3"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td align="center"><bold>5</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>50</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>95</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>5</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>50</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>95</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>5</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>50</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>95</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>5</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>50</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>95</bold></td></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td><td colspan="1"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td align="center"><bold>Gestational age (Week)</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>20</bold></td><td align="center">.69</td><td align="center">.75</td><td align="center">.86</td><td align="center">1.28</td><td align="cente